{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.asahi.magician",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "她拦住路人问魔术师在哪",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.asahi.magician",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.asahi.magician",
    "idolId": "asahi",
    "startNodeId": "1",
    "nodes": {
      "1": {
        "id": "1",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "『是，明天也请多指教。那么，失礼了。』",
        "nextNodeId": "2"
      },
      "2": {
        "id": "2",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "好，今天的预定到此结束。肚子也饿了，去哪儿吃点……",
        "nextNodeId": "3"
      },
      "3": {
        "id": "3",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……嗯？",
        "nextNodeId": "4"
      },
      "4": {
        "id": "4",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（あさひ……？在做什么呢……？）",
        "nextNodeId": "5"
      },
      "5": {
        "id": "5",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（去看看吧。）",
        "nextNodeId": "6"
      },
      "6": {
        "id": "6",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "那边吗～？",
        "nextNodeId": "7"
      },
      "7": {
        "id": "7",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "还是这边呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "8"
      },
      "8": {
        "id": "8",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "あさひ！",
        "nextNodeId": "9"
      },
      "9": {
        "id": "9",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "？",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      },
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "诶，不是制作人先生吗！在这种地方做什么呢？",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "我下班回来啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "什么嘛，原来是这样！",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "比起那个，我更好奇あさひ在做什么……",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "我吗？我在找有没有什么有趣的事！",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "然后听说公园里有魔术师，正打算去！",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "所以你到处问人，就是这个啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "是的！找有趣的事，基本就是从收集情报开始！",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "话是没错，不过别随便跟不认识的人说话啊？",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "？　什么意思？",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "世上不是只有好人。也可能会遇上危险。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "……唔。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "（她大概没被这么说过吧……不过该说的还是要说。）",
        "choices": [
          {
            "label": "我陪你去。",
            "nextNodeId": "100"
          },
          {
            "label": "魔术师是什么样的？",
            "nextNodeId": "110"
          },
          {
            "label": "下次要和我说一声。",
            "nextNodeId": "120"
          }
        ]
      },
      "100": {
        "id": "100",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "诶，可以吗！",
        "nextNodeId": "101"
      },
      "101": {
        "id": "101",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。一起去吧，比一个人到处问安全。",
        "nextNodeId": "102"
      },
      "102": {
        "id": "102",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "谢谢！那，走吧！"
      },
      "110": {
        "id": "110",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "听说他会从帽子里变出花来！",
        "nextNodeId": "111"
      },
      "111": {
        "id": "111",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "那确实挺有趣的。",
        "nextNodeId": "112"
      },
      "112": {
        "id": "112",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "对吧！我想看！"
      },
      "120": {
        "id": "120",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "要说一声……我知道了。",
        "nextNodeId": "121"
      },
      "121": {
        "id": "121",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。我会担心。",
        "nextNodeId": "122"
      },
      "122": {
        "id": "122",
        "speakerId": "asahi",
        "text": "……制作人先生，原来是会担心人的啊。"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
